<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call warrants on HK utility basket.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call warrants on HK utility basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said it had launched 450 million American-style call warrants on a basket of four Hong Kong utility stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd	    0.1 shares</p>
<p> Hong Kong &amp; China Gas Co Ltd	  0.1 shares</p>
<p> Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd	0.1 shares</p>
<p> Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd    0.1 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$9.411    PREMIUM	 9.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.180    GEARING	 5.7x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   30.MAR.98   MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$10.20    PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL OR CASH SETTLEMENT AT ISSUER'S</p>
<p>			  DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370  http://www.hk97.com</p>
